  "historyNote": "#8526, eff 12-21-05; ss by #10536, eff 3-6-14; ss by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1008.07) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
